keystroke-logs/

# Local product specifications and implementation concepts are private inputs.
# Public branches contain code, tests, and separately approved marketing only.
# DEBUG.md is deliberately NOT listed: it documents the shipped `smartkey-debug`
# tool and its trace levels, which a user needs in order to run it safely.
/.private-specs/
/receipts/
/lab_corpus/
